Why businesses use the Business Model Canvas
The BMC is popular because it helps teams:
Visualize an entire business on a single page.
Identify assumptions and gaps before investing heavily.
Communicate ideas clearly with investors, partners, and employees.
Compare different business models quickly.
Update and iterate as the business evolves.
It's especially useful in the early stages of a startup or when launching a new product, because it encourages thinking through all the critical pieces of the business , similar to a mind map for your business and can even be used to seek a grant from.
